  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\n## 2026-11-23 - 10.0.0.2-Beta-02\n\n- Added `AddOpenTelemetryTracingForK8s` TracerProviderBuilder extension for Kubernetes/EKS workloads (EKS resource detector, optional ASP.NET Core instrumentation, health-check filtering). Dynatrace endpoint/token are read from `IConfiguration` with environment variable fallback; if either is missing, no tracing is configured.\n\n## 2026-09-03 - 10.0.0.2-Beta-01\n \n-  updated main.yml to use common nuget workflow \n\n## 2026-08-13 - 10.0.0.0-Beta-05\n\n- Updated Readme.md file\n\n## 2026-08-05 - 10.0.0.0-Beta-04 \n\n- log object fields to lower case",
